WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.639
You might already be planning to go trick
or treating or bingeing the new season of

00:00:03.639 --> 00:00:07.420
Stranger Things this Halloween, but there
will also be a few freaky horror flicks worth

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.380
checking out around All Hallows' Eve.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:13.860
From the return of a few major franchises
to creative genre-busters and intriguing indie

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.540
scare-fests, here are all the new horror films
that will blow you away this Halloween.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.040
Cult of Chucky

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.360
You just can't keep an evil doll down.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.770
Dating back to Chucky's debut in 1988, the
Child's Play franchise has spanned six films,

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.980
all with the nightmare-haunting toy stalking
and slaying without abandon.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:34.800
Cult of Chucky picks up as a sequel to 2013's
Curse of Chucky, with a young woman in a mental

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.020
institution being gifted a doll that turns
out to be the hilarious plaything.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.860
The film will bring back Alex Vincent, Chucky's
original victim, as well as Chucky's wife

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:46.480
Tiffany and Nica Pierce from Curse of Chucky,
and, of course, the doll that started it all.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.040
"Hi.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.220
I'm Chucky.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.280
Wanna play?"

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.400
Count on this one to haunt your childhood
all over again when it hits theaters on October

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:54.900
3rd.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.600
"We're friends to the end, remember?"

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:58.980
Better Watch Out

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:03.000
This Christmas-set slasher pic has already
proven to be a hit on the festival circuit.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:07.200
The film might be a bit formulaic, as it features
a routine night of babysitting that goes horribly

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:07.700
wrong.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.500
But critics have been especially impressed
with this holiday-themed tale of a young woman

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.300
fighting off intruders while protecting her
pre-teen charge.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.640
So we can probably expect Better Watch Out
to give Santa's naughty list a whole new meaning

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.460
after this one drops on October 6th.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.140
Happy Death Day

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.500
What happens when you mash up Groundhog Day
with a horror flick?

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:29.960
Happy Death Day aims to find out by featuring
a young woman who basically has to re-live

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:33.460
her birthday over and over again — to find
out who's slaying her.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:35.440
"Sprinklers."

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:36.480
"Car alarm."

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.740
It's a teenage slasher with a clever twist,
and it could be just the thing to lure horror

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:44.440
fans to the theater again and again when it
arrives on October 13th.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.320
Leatherface

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.539
The Texas Chainsaw Massacre franchise has
been going strong for five decades, so it

00:01:50.539 --> 00:01:54.889
shouldn't be too much of a surprise that another
installment of the OG slasher classic is coming

00:01:54.889 --> 00:01:55.840
this Halloween season.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.539
This time, it's Leatherface, which will focus
in on the early days of the namesake villain

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:03.280
years before the events depicted in the original
Chainsaw.

00:02:03.469 --> 00:02:07.059
The film aims to build an origin story around
the title character, revealing the future

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.940
psycho was once a troubled youth involved
in the mysterious loss of the local sheriff's

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:11.440
daughter.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:16.040
He spends 10 years in a mental hospital before
escaping, and then the manhunt begins, with

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:20.380
the "deranged," revenge-seeking sheriff out
for Leatherface's, umm, hide.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.660
Prepare for jump scares and gore galore when
this pic hits theaters on October 20th.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:26.060
"What?"

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:28.980
The Snowman

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.780
Talk about a cold case.

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:34.620
In this crime thriller, an investigator is
reminded of a very old case when he

00:02:34.629 --> 00:02:38.650
finds a victim's scarf tied around the neck
of a snowman and begins thawing out other

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:40.540
unsolved crimes  that might be related.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.700
But by getting too snowed into the case, our
hero might find that icy glare trained on

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.640
himself and his loved ones sooner than later.

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:48.300
"You could've saved them.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:50.520
I gave you all the clues."

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:54.520
Get ready to experience all the chills when
The Snowman hits theaters October 20th.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:55.980
Jigsaw

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:00.049
The seventh installment of the Saw series
was supposed to be its last, but with so many

00:03:00.049 --> 00:03:03.740
games yet to be played, the filmmakers on
Jigsaw turned on their tape recorder for another

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:04.240
round.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:08.820
This time, the film will follow a new mysterious
psycho who gathers a group of victims to torture.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:12.860
But while the title character of Jigsaw has
been dead for years, investigators start to

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:16.840
notice some striking similarities between
his original work and this new protege's.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:20.060
"The truth will set you free"

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:24.200
These supposed copycat slayings will serve
as a reminder of the best and worst of the

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.140
prior installments and introduce some new
horrors for the trap-happy fanbase.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.760
So, get ready to make your choice on October
27th.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.800
"No, it's not creepy at all"

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.120
Thanks for watching!

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.560
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.260
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

